    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「誰のせいで、合唱部がこんな自堕落な感じになったと思ってるんですの～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ぜんぜん練習に顔ださないし、たまに部室にきたと思ったら寝たりお菓子食べたりとかで……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「これじゃあ、『合唱部』じゃなくて『昼寝部』ですのよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「いちおう発声練習とか、各パートの練習とか、人数足りなくてもできることはしてますのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「でも人数揃わないと、全体での合唱練習はできませんからね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「仕方ないから、全体練習すべき時間をこうして有意義に趣味のために活用してますのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「部員と仲良くなるのも、合唱部には必要なことですの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「こんなんじゃあ、もうすぐ予定されてる合唱大会にも参加できませんのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「練習不足で恥を晒すよりは、棄権したほうが『まし』ですからね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「まぁ、いいですけど。かいりも、そんなに一生懸命やるつもりないですから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「他にやりたいこともなくて、歌が好きだから合唱部に所属してるだけですし～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「あはは。自分も事務所からの指示で、合唱部に所属してるだけでありますからな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「仕事でも歌うっていうのに、部活でまで歌わされたら喉が嗄れちゃいます～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「プロが、アマチュアの世界を荒らすわけにもいきませんしね。」"
